px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_22.jpg&#34; srcset=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_22_hu_ddec98398f94df1a.jpg 800w, https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_22.jpg 1269w&#34; width=&#34;1269&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;180px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;75&#34; height=&#34;1692&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_23.jpg&#34; srcset=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_23_hu_dce7222d01c8ce17.jpg 800w, https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_23.jpg 1269w&#34; width=&#34;1269&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;接着是主板，后摄，第二个天线。被动散热片非常小。喇叭接口非常紧，所以就一起拆了。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;180px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;75&#34; height=&#34;1692&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_24.jpg&#34; srcset=&#34;https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_24_hu_380f61a9497c2f59.jpg 800w, https://scmj.blog/posts/ideapad-duet-3i-11ian8-%E5%90%AF%E5%A4%A9d11-%E6%8B%86%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%AE/image_24.jpg 1269w&#34; width=&#34;1269&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;全部装好，螺丝种类不多，不会放错。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;把老屏幕从边框上拆下来，这个边框非常稀有，咸鱼没有见到新货，必须要保护好。新屏幕用b7000胶水黏上，随后归位。总共耗费约2个半小时，希望能再用8年。但是按这个质量来说太悬了。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
